,1187,1188],{},"Normaliser",[18,1190,1191],{},"Réduction de bruit",[31,1193,1194],{},"Couper tout le clip, couper à une sélection, ou supprimer une sélection",[31,1196,1197],{},"Annuler \u002F rétablir",[31,1199,1200],{},"Zoomer et dézoomer",[23,1202,1204],{"id":1203},"préparer-et-importer","Préparer et importer",[28,1206,1207,1210,1213],{},[31,1208,1209],{},"Ajoute la sélection ou la piste complète à la liste de staging.",[31,1211,1212],{},"La liste commence vide : enregistre, édite, puis ajoute un clip.",[31,1214,1215,319,1217,577],{},[18,1216,573],{},[18,1218,576],{},[23,1220,1222],{"id":1221},"séparation-de-stems-optionnel","Séparation de stems (optionnel)",[14,1224,1225,1226,1229,1230,1233,1234,1237],{},"Les builds officiels Windows, macOS et Linux livrent la fonction ",[18,1227,1228],{},"stems",". Le Record Editor peut garder les ",[18,1231,1232],{},"voix"," ou la ",[18,1235,1236],{},"musique"," avec BS-RoFormer.",[14,1239,1240,1241,1244,1245,1248],{},"Le modèle fait environ 158 MB et n’est ",[18,1242,1243],{},"pas"," inclus dans l’installateur. Télécharge-le depuis ",[18,1246,1247],{},"Paramètres → Séparation de stems",", ou accepte l’invite au premier lancement. L’installateur Windows peut aussi proposer de télécharger le modèle au premier démarrage.",[14,1250,1251,1252,41,1255,1258],{},"Les builds source custom ont besoin d’un flag extra (",[38,1253,1254],{},"tauri:serve:stems",[38,1256,1257],{},"tauri:build:stems",").",{"title":139,"searchDepth":140,"depth":140,"links":1260},[1261,1262,1263,1264],{"id":1141,"depth":140,"text":1142},{"id":1174,"depth":140,"text":1175},{"id":1203,"depth":140,"text":1204},{"id":1221,"depth":140,"text":1222},"Capturer le micro ou l’audio du PC, éditer le clip et le poser sur ton board.",{},6,"\u002Frecording-editor",{"title":1127,"description":1265},"recording-editor","ZMpimB13mAmCTr4lHYb896wJ8oA5QijFuonM7e0rJU8",{"id":1273,"title":1274,"body":1275,"description":1487,"extension":147,"meta":1488,"navigation":149,"order":1489,"path":1490,"seo":1491,"stem":1492,"__hash__":1493},"content_fr\u002Fremote-control.md","Contrôle à distance",{"type":7,"value":1276,"toc":1480},[1277,1280,1283,1287,1316,1319,1322,1357,1361,1381,1384,1388,1420,1424,1430],[10,1278,1274],{"id":1279},"contrôle-à-distance",[14,1281,1282],{},"SoundNinja peut écouter sur ton réseau local pour que Bitfocus Companion (ou n’importe quel client HTTP\u002FWebSocket) joue et arrête des sons.",[23,1284,1286],{"id":1285},"activer-le-serveur-distant","Activer le serveur distant",[28,1288,1289,1294,1300,1306],{},[31,1290,505,1291,21],{},[18,1292,1293],{},"Paramètres → Distant",[31,1295,1296,1297,21],{},"Active le serveur distant. Le port par défaut est ",[18,1298,1299],{},"7331",[31,1301,1302,1303,21],{},"Optionnel : définis un token. Les clients doivent l’envoyer comme Bearer token ou ",[38,1304,1305],{},"?token=",[31,1307,1308,1309,1312,1313,21],{},"Copie l’URL ",[38,1310,1311],{},"http:\u002F\u002FIP:PORT",", ou copie l’IP système depuis ",[18,1314,1315],{},"Paramètres → À propos",[14,1317,1318],{},"Windows peut afficher une invite pare-feu la première fois que le serveur démarre. Autorise l’accès au réseau privé.",[23,1320,228],{"id":1321},"bitfocus-companion",[28,1323,1324,1331,1340,1350],{},[31,1325,1326,1327,21],{},"Installe ",[225,1328,228],{"href":1329,"rel":1330},"https:\u002F\u002Fbitfocus.io\u002Fcompanion",[246],[31,1332,1333,1334,1339],{},"Télécharge ",[225,1335,1338],{"href":1336,"rel":1337},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002FSoundNinja\u002Freleases\u002Flatest\u002Fdownload\u002FSoundNinja-Companion.tgz",[246],"SoundNinja-Companion.tgz",". Il n’y a pas encore de paquet Companion Store.",[31,1341,1342,1343,1346,1347,21],{},"Dans Companion : ",[18,1344,1345],{},"Modules → Load module package"," et choisis le ",[38,1348,1349],{},".tgz",[31,1351,1352,1353,1356],{},"Ajoute une connexion ",[18,1354,1355],{},"Sound Ninja",". Colle l’IP du PC, le port, et le token si tu en as défini un.",[23,1358,1360],{"id":1359},"actions","Actions",[66,1362,1363,1369,1375],{},[31,1364,1365,1368],{},[18,1366,1367],{},"Trigger Sound"," — choisis dans le menu déroulant live, ou tape un ID de son de 8 caractères (les variables Companion marchent)",[31,1370,1371,1374],{},[18,1372,1373],{},"Stop Sound"," — arrête un son en lecture par ID",[31,1376,1377,1380],{},[18,1378,1379],{},"Stop All"," — arrête tous les sons en lecture",[14,1382,1383],{},"Copie un ID de son dans SoundNinja depuis le menu contextuel du bouton ou la puce d’ID de la sélection multiple.",[23,1385,1387],{"id":1386},"feedbacks-et-variables","Feedbacks et variables",[66,1389,1390,1396,1408,1414],{},[31,1391,1392,1395],{},[18,1393,1394],{},"Sound Playing"," — vrai tant que cet ID de son est actif (utilise-le pour la couleur du bouton)",[31,1397,1398,1401,1402,41,1405],{},[38,1399,1400],{},"$(soundninja:connected)"," — ",[38,1403,1404],{},"true",[38,1406,1407],{},"false",[31,1409,1410,1413],{},[38,1411,1412],{},"$(soundninja:playing_count)"," — combien de sons jouent",[31,1415,1416,1419],{},[38,1417,1418],{},"$(soundninja:last_triggered)"," — dernier ID de son déclenché",[23,1421,1423],{"id":1422},"api-http-avancé","API HTTP (avancé)",[14,1425,1426,1427],{},"Chemin de base : ",[38,1428,1429],{},"\u002Fapi\u002Fv1",[66,1431,1432,1438,1444,1450,1460,1466,1474],{},[31,1433,1434,1437],{},[38,1435,1436],{},"GET \u002Finfo"," — nom de l’app, version, protocole, si un token est requis",[31,1439,1440,1443],{},[38,1441,1442],{},"GET \u002Fsounds"," — liste des sons (id, name, tabs, active)",[31,1445,1446,1449],{},[38,1447,1448],{},"GET \u002Fstate"," — sons plus IDs actuellement en lecture",[31,1451,1452,1455,1456,1459],{},[38,1453,1454],{},"POST \u002Ftrigger"," avec ",[38,1457,1458],{},"{ \"id\" }"," — jouer un son",[31,1461,1462,1465],{},[38,1463,1464],{},"GET \u002Ftrigger\u002F:id"," — jouer (facile à tester dans un navigateur)",[31,1467,1468,1455,1471,1473],{},[38,1469,1470],{},"POST \u002Fstop",[38,1472,1458],{}," optionne